WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.854
The paper contributes a deep joint model that
treats clinical presence as multi-task learning.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.642
A shared recurrent embedding feeds four heads:
longitudinal,

00:00:09.722 --> 00:00:12.925
inter-observation timing, missingness, and survival,

00:00:13.005 --> 00:00:17.975
all trained together by maximising a combined
likelihood with dynamic weighting.

00:00:18.055 --> 00:00:22.268
The result is a representation that encodes the
observation process,

00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:26.750
giving both a predictive edge and robustness when
that process changes.
